title: "LITHOS: Literature Retrieval and Source Validation for Scoping Reviews"
abstract: "An expert-grade, dependency-light command line tool and Python library for systematic and scoping review literature retrieval across multiple scholarly databases, with deduplication, validation, screening, analytics, and reproducible reporting."
